    "text": "20 hours ago The opening locator in \"Silence of the Lambs\" serves as a clever misdirection for a key scene later in the film. I recently rewatched Silence of the Lambs, my favorite film, for about the hundredth time. It's a very tight movie, without a single unnecessary detail, so I was surprised when I noticed something that seemed a little strange — perhaps even amateurish — in the very first scene. Read full article",
